# Rust sources are scanned as text by tests (include_str!), so keep their
# line endings identical on every platform, including Windows CI checkouts.
*.rs text eol=lf

# The backend-samples fixture and generated TypeScript bindings are compared byte for byte
# with generated output (type_contract.rs), so a Windows checkout must not turn their line
# endings into CRLF.
*.fixture.json text eol=lf
src/types.generated.ts text eol=lf
